[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4076069133","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005#issuecomment-4076069133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005","id":4076069133,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY87y8-EN","user":{"login":"Koroqe","id":24411116,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDExMTE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24411116?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koroqe","html_url":"https://github.com/Koroqe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koroqe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koroqe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koroqe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koroqe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koroqe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koroqe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koroqe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koroqe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koroqe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-17T15:57:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-17T15:57:20Z","body":"The fragmentation is brutal. I have 12 agent definitions that need to live somewhere standard, and right now it's all locked into .claude/ with no portability.\n\nFor now I keep everything in a single CLAUDE.md with per-agent sections + a scratchpad for session state. At least it's one file to maintain instead of symlink hacks. Would switch to AGENTS.md in a heartbeat if it were supported.\n\nhttps://github.com/Koroqe/claude-code-sdlc — current workaround structure.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4076069133/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4103589512","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005#issuecomment-4103589512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005","id":4103589512,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY870l86I","user":{"login":"alxvasilevvv","id":213174208,"node_id":"U_kgDODLTHwA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213174208?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxvasilevvv","html_url":"https://github.com/alxvasilevvv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxvasilevvv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxvasilevvv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxvasilevvv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxvasilevvv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxvasilevvv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxvasilevvv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxvasilevvv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxvasilevvv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxvasilevvv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-21T15:42:26Z","updated_at":"2026-03-21T15:42:26Z","body":"We use AGENTS.md extensively at MEEET World (707 agents coordinated through a shared API + skill system). Happy to share our patterns if useful for this feature.\n\n[Our agent architecture](https://github.com/alxvasilevvv/meeet-solana-state)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4103589512/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4138074312","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005#issuecomment-4138074312","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005","id":4138074312,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY872pgDI","user":{"login":"yurukusa","id":254115176,"node_id":"U_kgDODyV9aA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254115176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa","html_url":"https://github.com/yurukusa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-26T20:41:41Z","updated_at":"2026-03-26T20:41:41Z","body":"While waiting for official AGENTS.md support, Claude Code's existing features already cover most of the use cases described here. Here's how:\n\n**Hierarchical CLAUDE.md** works as agent definition files. Claude Code loads them in cascade:\n\n```\n~/.claude/CLAUDE.md          # global rules (all projects)\n~/CLAUDE.md                  # home-level rules\n./CLAUDE.md                  # project-level rules\n./.claude/CLAUDE.md          # project-specific (gitignored)\n```\n\nEach level can define different \"agent personas\" — behavioral constraints, tool preferences, output formats. The cascade means you define shared rules once at the top and override per-project.\n\n**`.claude/commands/`** is the skills directory. Each `.md` file becomes a slash command:\n\n```\n~/.claude/commands/review.md     # /review — available everywhere\n./.claude/commands/deploy.md     # /deploy — project-specific\n```\n\nInside each command file, you define the agent's behavior for that task — what tools to use, what checks to run, what format to output. This is functionally equivalent to `.agents/skills/`.\n\n**Practical structure** that works today:\n\n```\nproject/\n  CLAUDE.md                    # Agent definition: role, constraints, judgment rules\n  .claude/\n    commands/\n      plan.md                  # /plan — architecture planning agent behavior\n      review.md                # /review — code review agent behavior\n      deploy.md                # /deploy — deployment agent behavior\n  tasks/\n    todo.md                    # Task queue for autonomous execution\n```\n\nThe CLAUDE.md hierarchy + commands directory gives you per-agent behavioral definitions, per-project skill libraries, and shared rules — without needing a separate AGENTS.md spec.\n\nWhat's genuinely missing vs. AGENTS.md: cross-tool portability (same definitions working in Cursor, Copilot, etc.) and a standardized discovery mechanism. Those are real gaps that only official support would solve. But for \"define agent behaviors and skills in Claude Code,\" the building blocks are already there.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4138074312/reactions","total_count":36,"+1":0,"-1":36,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4143165642","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005#issuecomment-4143165642","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005","id":4143165642,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY87287DK","user":{"logi