,"gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcurbelo","html_url":"https://github.com/jcurbelo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcurbelo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcurbelo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcurbelo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcurbelo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcurbelo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcurbelo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcurbelo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcurbelo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcurbelo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-10T15:35:21Z","updated_at":"2026-04-10T15:35:21Z","body":"tested on `v2.1.100`: `.agents/skills/` still returns \"Unknown skill.\"\n\nper-skill symlinks from `.claude/skills/` to `.agents/skills/` work though, so the discovery path is the only thing missing\n\nany updates?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4224889363/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4393391699","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005#issuecomment-4393391699","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005","id":4393391699,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY88AAAABBd3WUw","user":{"login":"airtonix","id":61225,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMjI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61225?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/airtonix","html_url":"https://github.com/airtonix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airtonix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airtonix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airtonix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airtonix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airtonix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airtonix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airtonix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airtonix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airtonix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-07T01:23:08Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T01:25:07Z","body":"It's pretty obvious that this is an intentional marketing/growth hack strategy.\n\nSo only voting with your wallet will change their mind.\n\nWe treat claude as the exception, and it just gets symlinks and we adopt none of their features other than `.agents/skills/**/*` and `.agents/commands/**/*.md`","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4393391699/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4397135690","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005#issuecomment-4397135690","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005","id":4397135690,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY88AAAABBhb3Sg","user":{"login":"olijboyd","id":215145242,"node_id":"U_kgDODNLbGg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215145242?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olijboyd","html_url":"https://github.com/olijboyd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olijboyd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olijboyd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olijboyd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olijboyd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olijboyd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olijboyd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olijboyd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olijboyd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olijboyd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-07T12:34:45Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T12:34:45Z","body":"Adding to the workaround stack since this thread is the de facto reference until Anthropic responds.\n\nOne pattern that hasn't come up: @AGENTS.md as a CLAUDE.md import works in current Claude Code:\n\n@AGENTS.md\n\nTradeoff vs the approaches already posted:\n\n- vs per-skill symlinks (@jcurbelo): no filesystem-permission / Windows edge cases\n- vs pr_guard sync (@kingpanther13): single source of truth, no sync to enforce\n- vs CLAUDE.md hierarchy + .claude/commands/ (@yurukusa): keeps AGENTS.md as the canonical filename for cross-tool consumers\n\nCaveats from our usage: /compact can drop imported content mid-session (separate known issue), and Claude-native affordances (skills auto-trigger, slash commands) still need .claude/ siblings, they don't fire from inside an imported file.\n\nFor repos that also have to feed Cursor / Windsurf / Copilot / Gemini from the same source, there's a free fan-out converter at https://tomevault.io/studio (disclosure: I run it). Doesn't fix the underlying issue, just handles the multi-loader case for the formats Claude Code doesn't read natively today.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4397135690/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_