,"id":4946206214,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY88AAAABJtEeBg","user":{"login":"EvilConsultant","id":28223595,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MjIzNTk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28223595?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvilConsultant","html_url":"https://github.com/EvilConsultant","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvilConsultant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvilConsultant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvilConsultant/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvilConsultant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvilConsultant/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvilConsultant/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvilConsultant/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvilConsultant/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvilConsultant/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-11T13:31:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-11T13:31:08Z","body":"This has become more and more challenging as skills and agents and everything in the .agents folder grows. Resetting links after every edit isn't a good user experience, and this would be a significant quality of life improvement. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4946206214/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/5006527870","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005#issuecomment-5006527870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005","id":5006527870,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY88AAAABKmmNfg","user":{"login":"banagale","id":1409710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDk3MTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1409710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/banagale","html_url":"https://github.com/banagale","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banagale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banagale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banagale/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banagale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banagale/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banagale/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banagale/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banagale/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/banagale/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-17T18:53:19Z","updated_at":"2026-07-17T19:11:58Z","body":"Kimi K3 also uses `.agents/skills`\n\nI've just flipped my entire symlink architecture from `.claude/skills` as triforce to having claude be the special snowflake symlinking to .agents/skills.\n\nThis is a problem for applications trying to deliver their own skills.  In my app, [Contextify](https://contextify.sh), I want to deliver skills for Claude Code and Codex.  Previously, I've just written to each `.[ai-agent]/skills` but if I want to support all agents, I now have to write logic to determine if the user is centralized on either.  \n\nIf I blindly symlink .claude/skills to .agent/skills it may pull some other unexpected tools into .claude's environment.\n\nI want to avoid reading and writing and mucking with a person's environment as much as possible. This could all be solved by Claude Code supporting the fallback directory of `.agent`\n\nPlease reconsider making .agents the fallback to .claude. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/5006527870/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/5021431136","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005#issuecomment-5021431136","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/31005","id":5021431136,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY88AAAABK0z1YA","user":{"login":"arunmm8335","id":176393077,"node_id":"U_kgDOCoOLdQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176393077?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arunmm8335","html_url":"https://github.com/arunmm8335","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arunmm8335/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arunmm8335/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arunmm8335/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arunmm8335/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arunmm8335/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arunmm8335/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arunmm8335/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arunmm8335/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arunmm8335/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T10:52:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T10:52:08Z","body":"While native AGENTS.md / `.agents/skills/` support is the right long-term fix, teams running Claude Code alongside Codex/Cursor still have to keep multiple layouts in sync today.\n\nI open-sourced a small workaround for that: [agentpkg](https://github.com/arunmm8335/agentpkg) — one manifest installs skills/rules/MCP configs into each agent's native paths, with a SHA-256 lockfile so installs can be verified in CI (useful after