er agent is asking, Claude Code, Cursor, etc. It also has a simple claim system so two agents on the same tree don’t silently overwrite each other.\n\npip install knos\nhttps://github.com/drexthealpha/Knos\n\nIt’s pure local SQLite, no account, no cloud. Happy to take any brutal feedback if anyone tries it as a temporary bridge until Claude Code finally supports AGENTS.md natively.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/5497539852/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]